<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Placer Dome extends Placer Pac offer.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Placer Dome extends Placer Pac offer.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Placer Dome Inc said on Friday it was extending its takeover offer for its 75 percent-owned subsidiary Placer Pacific Ltd for 10 days to March 7.</p>
<p>Placer Dome has offered one of its shares for every 15 Placer Pacific shares. The offer values Placer pacific shares at between A$180 to A$1.85 each. Placer Pacific directors earlier on Friday recommended shareholders accept the offer.</p>
<p>Placer Pacific shares closed two cents down at A$1.76.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
